  "id": "telepsychotherapy",
  "term": "telepsychotherapy",
  "definition": "Telepsychotherapy is psychotherapy carried out through communication technology rather than meeting in person. In this study, patients described it as a qualitatively different form of therapy that can feel safer or freer for some people, while also reducing rituals, emotional openness, and sense of rapport for others.",
